  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nP = frac{x²-100}{x²-16}\n\nQ = (x+10)/(x-4)\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a+b)(a-b)\n\n**Solution:**\n\nP = frac{x²-100}{x²-16} = ((x -10)(x + 10))/((x-4)(x+4))\n\n(P)/(Q) = ((x -10)(x + 10))/((x-4)(x+4)) times ((x-4))/((x+10)) = (x-10)/(x+4)\n\nHence,\n\n(P)/(Q) = (x-10)/(x+4)",
